%SIXMD 1
# @?SLEEP - SLEEP FOR A NUMBER OF SECONDS

## DESCRIPTION

SLEEPS USING THE CURRENT DAIMOS MONOTONIC 60-HZ SLEEP SYSCALL.

USAGE IS 'SLEEP SECONDS'.

THIS COMMAND IS IMPLEMENTED ENTIRELY IN PDP-6 ASSEMBLER AND IS PART OF THE
OPTIONAL ASMUTILS PACKAGE. IT IS INSTALLED IN /OPTION/BASE/EXEC.

## @?FILES

### @?/OPTION/BASE/EXEC/SLEEP
OPTIONAL EXECUTABLE.

### @?/OPTION/BASE/SOURCE/ASMUTILS/SLEEP.S
ASSEMBLER SOURCE.

